1.Proposed the Hepa-Vein dataset with dense labeling;
2.Good quantitative results were achieved on both the Hepa-Vein and the external DSAD datasets. For the extremely small and intermittently occurring “Blood Point” category, a significant improvement in the Dice score was realized compared to existing methods.
3.By adopting the critic-free GRPO algorithm, the framework avoids the expensive computational overhead associated with approximating value functions in high dimensional long surgical video scenarios

